{
  "version": 1,
  "$comment": "The Road (docs/KID_REDESIGN.md §3): Player mode's chapters of nodes. Each node is a set of 5 reps about one to three principles; 'mix' nodes draw from their chapter ('from'). A chapter's 'opensAfter' opens its first node early: 'Help the ball' and 'Pass it right' open after Close Them Down, so attackers get attacking plays early while defending stays open. 'lead' names, per position group, the chapter whose open nodes Next up offers first (none: the Road's order). 'quickPass' names the pass nodes the home's quick \"Who's open?\" set takes in turn. 'skill' names a chapter's rating on the player card; 'icon' marks it on the Road when its title is not shown. Helpers and set building: js/ui/player/road.js. Node titles: 4 words or fewer, simple words (principles' kidName where it fits).",
  "groups": { "DEF": ["CB", "FB"], "MID": ["DM", "CM"], "WING": ["W"], "STRIKER": ["ST"] },
  "defaultRoles": { "DEF": "LB", "MID": "LCM", "WING": "LW", "STRIKER": "ST" },
  "lead": { "MID": "help", "WING": "help", "STRIKER": "help" },
  "quickPass": ["free-player", "play-forward"],
  "matchday": { "unlockAfter": "defend-match" },
